                    NSAM 246. Top Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d384-f2" n="2" xml:id="d384-f2-content">
                <p>The President had two “off the record” meetings during the morning of May 20, but
                    his Appointment Book does not indicate the topics discussed. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
